{"ts": "2026-09-05T03:34:28.614607+00:00", "kind": "warning", "sig": "orchestrator/td960bf166c.out.log:1e56b0b1349b", "detail": "The result: **every** `run_shell` failure — whether it's an allowlist violation (\"command not allowlisted\"), a timeout, or a real exception — collapses into the single generic signature `run_shell:c73866f2f1b5` (which is the content-hash of `run_shell|backend reported failure`). The real error never survives the round-trip, so agents keep retrying non-allowlisted commands, generating more failures, and the FKB spike grows.", "tool": "orchestrator/td960bf166c.out.log", "error": "The result: **every** `run_shell` failure — whether it's an allowlist violation (\"command not allowlisted\"), a timeout, or a real exception — collapses into the single generic signature `run_shell:c73866f2f1b5` (which is the content-hash of `run_shell|backend reported failure`). The real error never", "phase": "passive-monitor", "session_id": null, "provider": null, "model": null}
